# Optional Google Search Console HTML-tag verification.
# After https://huggingface.it.com serves this site over HTTPS:
# 1. Add the property at https://search.google.com/search-console
# 2. Choose HTML tag verification and copy the content= token only
# 3. Set VITE_GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION in GitHub Actions secrets (same name)
#    or locally here, then rebuild. Do not invent a token.
# VITE_GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION=
